  "description": "Yongcheonsan, a child chosen by God, was born. From the moment he was born, he had to surrender himself to the fate God had ordained for him, and when he felt like crying, he had to laugh. He had to roll his body to prevent the passage of time from seeping into his living soul, and when faced with a cruel fate, he had to face it with dignity and not kneel. This epic tale of siblings fighting against the teeth of time that gnaw at their own lives to protect the destiny of their younger brother, chosen by God, unfolds.\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
